---
import { withBasePath } from '../lib/paths'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL
---

<article class="service-card" aria-labelledby="channel-choice-title">
  <span class="kicker">贰 · 渠道适配（二选一）</span>
  <span class="name" id="channel-choice-title">钉钉 / 飞书渠道</span>
  <span class="context"><code>ctx.dingtalk</code> / <code>ctx.feishu</code></span>
  <span class="summary">通知配置选择一个渠道适配器；业务代码通常只调用 <code>ctx.notify</code>，无需感知当前使用钉钉还是飞书。</span>
  <span class="links">
    <a href={withBasePath(base, '/docs/dingtalk')}>钉钉文档</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
    <a href={withBasePath(base, '/docs/feishu')}>飞书文档</a>
  </span>
</article>

<style>
  .service-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 16px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .context,
  .summary {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--quote);
  }
  .links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
